#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:280
msgid "Equations"
msgstr "Ecuaciones"

#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:282
msgid ""
"Equations are a little different, ``:ref:`label``` does not work. They are "
"instead called with the ``:eq:`label``` syntax. You cannot choose what text "
"displays in the reference like you can with titles, headings, figures, and "
"tables. Whenever you reference an equation, parentheses surrounding the "
"equation's number will be the linked-text."
msgstr ""
"Equations are a little different, ``:ref:`label``` does not work. They are "
"instead called with the ``:eq:`label``` syntax. You cannot choose what text "
"displays in the reference like you can with titles, headings, figures, and "
"tables. Whenever you reference an equation, parentheses surrounding the "
"equation's number will be the linked-text."

#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:284
msgid ""
"Equations: ``:eq:`quadratic_equation``` only generates a number in "
"parentheses. Thus, this reference is usually preceeded by the word: "
"'equation.' Like this: Equation :eq:`quadratic_equation`."
msgstr ""
"Equations: ``:eq:`quadratic_equation``` only generates a number in "
"parentheses. Thus, this reference is usually preceeded by the word: "
"'equation.' Like this: Equation :eq:`quadratic_equation`."

#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:288
msgid "Citations"
msgstr "Citas"

#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:290
msgid ""
"Heavily used `this reference <http://build-me-the-docs-"
"please.readthedocs.io/en/latest/Using_Sphinx/UsingBibTeXCitationsInSphinx.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"Muy utilizado `esta referencia <http://build-me-the-docs-"
"please.readthedocs.io/en/latest/Using_Sphinx/UsingBibTeXCitationsInSphinx.html>`_"

#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:292
msgid ""
"Parenthetical referencing can be produced in Sphinx_ using the "
"sphinxcontrib-bibtex_ extension."
msgstr ""
"La referencia entre paréntesis puede producirse en Sphinx_ usando la "
"extensión sphinxcontrib-bibtex_."

#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:295
msgid ""
"The sphinxcontrib-bibtex_ extension allows BibTeX_ citations to be inserted "
"into documentation generated by Sphinx."
msgstr ""
"La extensión sphinxcontrib-bibtex_ permite insertar BibTeX_ citas en la "
"documentación generada por Sphinx."

#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:298
msgid ""
"The extension defines a new ``bibliography`` directive and a new ``cite`` "
"role."
msgstr ""
"La prórroga define una nueva directiva ``bibliography`` y un nuevo rol "
"``cite`` ."

#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:300
msgid ""
"These work similarly to the LaTeX's ``thebibliography`` environment and "
"``\\cite`` command."
msgstr ""
"Estos funcionan de forma similar al entorno ``thebibliography`` y al comando"
" ``\\cite`` del LaTeX."

#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:303
msgid ""
"The references are stored in a separate plain text BibTeX format file. "
"Currently, only the ``unsrt`` and ``plain`` BibTeX styles are supported."
msgstr ""
"Las referencias se almacenan en un archivo BibTeX de texto plano separado. "
"Actualmente, solo se soportan los estilos BibTeX ``unsrt`` y ``plain`` ."

#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:306
msgid ""
"Additionally, PDFs of sources are stored in the \"_static/references\" "
"folder, which then uses internal links, ensures we never lose access, and  "
"keeps everything in one place."
msgstr ""
"Además, los PDFs de las fuentes se almacenan en la carpeta "
"\"_static/references\", que utiliza enlaces internos, asegura que nunca "
"perdamos el acceso y mantiene todo en un solo lugar."

